🧩 What to change if the package name changes

If you do not want to keep the package jiraIntegration, you can rename it, but then all affected classes must be updated consistently.

This includes:
	•	Groovy package declarations
	•	imports
	•	CustomKeywords calls
	•	listener references

The safest option is to keep the original package name during the first migration.

